<span data-as="p">Lock the <code>hooks</code> surface. Claude Code stops running hooks from user, project, and local <code>settings.json</code>, and keeps running plugin hooks and hooks in managed settings.</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>Scope</strong>: <a href="#scopes" class="link"><code>Managed</code></a></li>
<li><strong>Type</strong>: the string <code>&quot;hooks&quot;</code> in the <a href="#strictpluginonlycustomization" class="link"><code>strictPluginOnlyCustomization</code></a> array</li>
<li><strong>Default</strong>: not locked</li>
</ul>
