</code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div>
<span id="authentication-and-login"></span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="authentication-and-providers"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#authentication-and-providers" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Authentication and providers</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">Supply credentials through helper scripts and, for organizations, force a login method or organization. See <a class="link" href="/docs/en/authentication">Authentication</a>.</span>
<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="apikeyhelper"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#apikeyhelper" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer"><code>apiKeyHelper</code></span></h3>
<span data-as="p">Run your own command to produce the credential Claude Code sends with model requests. Claude Code runs the command through the system shell, <code>/bin/sh</code> on macOS and Linux and <code>cmd</code> on Windows, and sends its output as both the <code>X-Api-Key</code> and <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> headers. Use it for dynamic or rotating credentials, such as short-lived tokens fetched from a vault.</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>Scope</strong>: <a href="#scopes" class="link"><code>Any file</code></a></li>
<li><strong>Type</strong>: string, a shell command line</li>
<li><strong>Default</strong>: unset, so Claude Code doesn’t run a helper</li>
</ul>
<div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark p-0.5" numberOfLines="3" language="json"><div class="flex text-gray-400 text-xs rounded-t-[14px] leading-6 font-medium pl-4 pr-2.5 py-1" data-component-part="code-block-header"><div class="grow-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 min-w-0" data-component-part="code-block-header-filename"><span class="truncate min-w-0" title="settings.json">settings.json</span></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_1tiobcllktbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/code-snippet-feedback-button in-data-floating-buttons:group-[:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))]:bg-gray-100 dark:in-data-floating-buttons:group-[:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))]:bg-gray-800" id="code-snippet-feedback-button" aria-label="Report incorrect code"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/code-snippet-feedback-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/code-snippet-feedback-button:text-white/60"><path d="M9 5.431V9.569" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 11.417C8.449 11.417 8 11.866 8 12.417C8 12.968 8.449 13.417 9 13.417C9.551 13.417 10 12.968 10 12.417C10 11.866 9.551 11.417 9 11.417Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M10.968 2.25H7.03301C6.50301 2.25 5.99401 2.461 5.61901 2.836L2.83701 5.618C2.46201 5.993 2.25101 6.502 2.25101 7.032V10.967C2.25101 11.497 2.46201 12.006 2.83701 12.381L5.61901 15.163