<div role="note" aria-label="Warning" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-yellow-200 bg-yellow-50 dark:border-yellow-900 dark:bg-yellow-600/20 [&amp;_[data-component-part=&#x27;callout-icon&#x27;]]:mt-px" data-callout-type="warning"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="flex-none size-5 text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300"><path d="M 9 6.75 v 1.5 m 0 3 h 0.0075 m -5.2035 3 h 10.392 c 1.155 0 1.8765 -1.2503 1.299 -2.25 L 10.299 3 c -0.5775 -0.9997 -2.0205 -0.9997 -2.598 0 L 2.505 12 c -0.5775 0.9997 0.144 2.25 1.299 2.25 z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">Removed in v2.1.234, together with its <code>/config</code> row <strong>Default teammate model</strong>. Setting it has no effect on current versions.</span></div></div>
<span data-as="p">Through v2.1.233, you set this key to the model for <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-teams#specify-teammates-and-models">agent team</a> teammates your prompt didn’t name a model for: an alias such as <code>&quot;sonnet&quot;</code>, or <code>null</code> to follow the lead’s model. For the model Claude Code picks for such teammates now, see <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-teams#specify-teammates-and-models">specify teammates and models</a>.</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>Scope</strong>: <a href="#scopes" class="link"><code>Global config</code></a>. On v2.1.233 and earlier.</li>
<li><strong>Type</strong>: string, a model alias or full model ID, or <code>null</code></li>
<li><strong>Default</strong>: unset</li>
</ul>
